    "summary": "Server exits immediately after startup; need to ensure Uvicorn stays running and application doesn't terminate post-initialization",
    "rationale_summary": "The server process shuts down immediately after startup, indicating the application is exiting prematurely. This likely stems from either (1) Uvicorn being run in a mode that exits after startup without requests, or (2) the FastAPI application having an uncaught exception during initialization. The health check endpoint addition did not resolve this, suggesting the root cause lies in startup configuration or application state.",
